RWAXm0hU/v0/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;一架中国海军直升机飞越南海黄岩岛上空。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：Ezra Acayan/Getty Images&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;据半官方的中央通讯社报道，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;台湾计划到 2027 年在军费上投入&lt;/strong&gt;创纪录的数额，超过 GDP 的 3%，此举是在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/_T097_T_r85Mn5mps8P3Xx_kmJ8Gf4uXfbYaFrbpRLdceDXDQrBLBE9AudAuOcBuUbwG0qK7p53f6dnXw9Ss4MzdgEKe0bYqX2imGbAbIDEl5jlNvYkttO95ccBlDVPC_h0F8sOChfPOgyJEz0_RXKybmyr4fUtz0uVnvbiS7LYbvdmbrTu1aMcCynh6DqxWtiyT4TsNsquXzXvFTdvguoyUBTipC86TKN9tAptSLpgaDVR1Z5hO5u1KbLp1dVJ8aAjkfTxjeGq8km-Qcp1yx6MG9bsJ6Z9d05DUEuWYoK4SvR4XZX_1m6ojd1FGVM16JArNCY5wkIhYYvNjb9o5Nl4W5eRn_dPkjc5YxRVl-ig8YhCAJFy2PbGANXVYoyHPo_x3ldykrHImjf_SW69hEgGxij7zarTrTpLy3Axxqf75RZwQWk7AKYhFN19Jv9rTehtihHo_uCSkm3kg3DzlPkAIddt1rIkxvFQAIUF1KI_kEca7Cvj4L71dwmh37ZTOG1f41pj-nVLn-hNl9ugSzyM_8lrZMoGz5Wpt8ZuOJJMX/AHZOW_ceDVm1b29mmIN2ScUVjEYX75U1/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="报告称，台湾计划创纪录的国防预算以对抗中国"&gt;美国敦促台湾采取更多措施&lt;/a&gt;威慑中国之际采取的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;缅甸军方支持的&lt;/strong&gt;政府拒绝了东南亚国家联盟关于&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/-Qr8Y_WqD_XNd8OFFavZ1l5Ue36sMg5Z4WpSZ__fJgYcOqK5Q9RIERMWvLC5TgNqg2liLFnCOHaUV0GEz7tr1atQnLUIkxVX2Gde6IKYG9krXgmuthMiTaL7CECeJa4faSv0wXOP_J07dMSRz-JEZvsgU1SHm1nqjVTZycwXNoQ_MkOlmIWBulEkAzl4QP8SwYIDC0WAYbAvkCTcFL5vjpYm_rF3YM1ew228kFDl1h-zKmKNqJZ-g433KcstnUcZkhj7sJhb0sGcW3Z-55POK4M2JbW6bE5gbfoI3_RfPUNWyBo6KNhNa9fMYGfnFcFBrAXGsRhlLzmh_1o-FL2LyJAfaHcl1u31ARAI2x_dpkCR69bXEfNdEAoQ0YzXMjDvgj7jJNOVTKoyFJFqFUYwPqnaAIHVxKrQ7VQhKSgny6P0iS-eDCeLc-sr3MxAiSgeKaufz2frcxOLhcc1SbZwuo